  "description": "The dead have sealed the gates of light. In every graveyard a celestial exit shimmers somewhere, but it stays locked until every glass case in the graveyard is smashed. Find a case by its knocking, get beside it until the bell rings, and press Space to smash it. Every smash wakes two or three ghosts, who come for you from far off, silent at first, then whispering. Away from a case, Space fires your laser at whatever is centred between your ears, in front or behind: one hit sends a ghost away, for five points. A ghost that reaches you steals ten seconds and vanishes. There is no ammo lying about: most cases hold five shots, and some hold 15 to 45 extra seconds, so do not waste a shot. Once the last case is smashed, walk out through the exit to the next graveyard, with three to nine cases. You start with three minutes and six shots. Enter tells you how you are doing, and T tells you the time left.",
